the spider-man no way home teaser  dropped late on the night of august 23rd  almost 24 hours after it leaked on  twitter it was a mad scramble to get the  leaked teaser off of social media and  the clips began disappearing from  timelines unfortunately plenty of people  still saw the teaser despite the efforts  to get rid of it marvel studios and sony  pictures did what they had to do and  dropped the beautiful full-length hd  teaser of no way home to the excitement  of fans who were awaiting the official  release after the leaked mess was  unleashed only the day prior in the  teaser we got to see peter parker  spending some quality time with mj as  the two deal with the reveal of  spider-man's identity to the world the  teaser also features doctor strange who  will play a significant role in the film  the sorcerer supreme grants peter a wish  and performs a spell that should make  the world forget who spider-man is of  course squeaky peter interrupts doctor  strange and it looks like the pair also  opens a pathway to the multiverse the  fallout from doctor strange's spell  leads to all-out chaos and the viewers  are subsequently treated to sneak peeks  of some of the movie's villains  for quite some time now rumors have  suggested that some significant villains  from former spider-man films would be  appearing in no way home alfred molina  surprisingly confirmed dr octopus would  be back and he showed up in a big way in  the teaser at the end of the lengthy  clip we see the villain's signature  robotic tentacles bust through asphalt  before the man himself appears out of a  smoke cloud in his trench coats and  sunglasses as he says  hello peter the dangerous spider-man 2  villain is the clearest and most present  threat in spider-man no way home but he  definitely isn't going to be the only  adversary for everyone's favorite  multiverse spider-man just before doc  ock appears viewers get a glimpse at a  weapon used by a notorious spidey  villain green goblin's pumpkin bomb  comes rolling down the street to the  beautiful familiar sound of a chaotic  chuckling  most fans of sam remy's early 2000s  spider-man trilogy will recognize this  as the voice of norman osborne played by  the great willem dafoe though we don't  see defoe's character outlets like  cbr.com have reported that this won't be  the case in the actual movie and green  goblin may actually be the main villain  of no way home the teaser proves that he  will quite definitely be in the film and  his considerable powers and larger than  life personality certainly make him a  valid big bad candidate for the entire  film it seems as though no way home is  building towards something a bit bigger  than just those two villains several  shots of lightning in the teaser trailer  drop a not so subtle hint at electro's  presence in no way home a villain made  famous by jamie foxx in the amazing  spider-man 2. in october 2020 the  hollywood reporter revealed that fox  would be reprising his role and the  lightning bolts in the trailer are the  perfect tease to his triumphant  restoration additionally there appears  to be a sand storm mixed in with some of  the lightning sequences which might very  well mean that thomas hayden church's  sandman from spider-man 3 is also back  for a rematch there's even a blink and  you'll miss a jump scare moment from  reese evens the lizard who appeared in  the amazing spider-man this fantastic  new teaser trailer pretty much confirms  that these five villains will be a part  of no way home and we suspect there's at  least one more coming as the sinister  six has long been rumored to be a part  of the film in the comics many villains  have played a role in the group over the  years so multiple characters could fill  that last spot the scorpion from  spider-man homecoming is a potential  sixth member and of course there's the  main big bad from homecoming still  flying around so to speak michael  keaton's vulture is showing up in  morbius so there's that character's  potential for no way home you can catch  spider-man no way home when it lands in  theaters on december 17th  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  spider-man are coming soon subscribe to  our youtube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

